    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cLos Angeles 1985\u201d is an anthology yuri romance kinetic novel. Follow in the steps of four women in Los Angeles in 1985 as they live through the fast-paced glamour of the 1980s and explore both themselves, the City of Angels and go through a voyage in lesbian love. Follow four loveable ladies in two thoughtful and heartwarming tales about finding love when you least expect it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful anime style art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two romantic and heartwarming plotlines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >80s style pop and synthwave soundtrack</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cLos Angeles 1985\u201d is an anthology yuri romance kinetic novel. Follow in the steps of four women in Los Angeles in 1985 as they live through the fast-paced glamour of the 1980s and explore both themselves, the City of Angels and go through a voyage in lesbian love. Follow four loveable ladies in two thoughtful and heartwarming tales about finding love when you least expect it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful anime style art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two romantic and heartwarming plotlines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >80s style pop and synthwave soundtrack</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "\u201cLos Angeles 1985\u201d is a yuri romance kinetic novel bathed in neon heat. Two intimate tales follow four women as they navigate desire, heartbreak, and passion under the electric skies of LA. Love burns brightest after dark.",
